Output tapes/json.gif

Require cargo

Set Shell "bash"
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set FontSize 32
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600

Type@50ms "cargo run -q --bin json tapes/kubernetes.json" Enter Sleep 2s
Down@300ms 4 Sleep 1s
Space Sleep 1s
Down@300ms 1 Sleep 1s
Space Sleep 1s
Down@200ms 2 Sleep 1s
Enter Sleep 2s
